# fp6-mobian-support: the Fairphone (Gen. 6) boots only the milos kernel
# (linux-image-*-milos, not in any archive yet). Keep Debian's and Mobian's
# kernel images off this phone: zz-qcom-bootimg would otherwise be tempted to
# pack one of them into boot_a. Remove this file only together with a kernel
# that supports the FP6.
Explanation: no Debian kernels on the FP6
Package: linux-image-* linux-headers-* linux-kbuild-*
Pin: release o=Debian
Pin-Priority: -1

Explanation: no Mobian kernels on the FP6
Package: linux-image-* linux-headers-*
Pin: release o=Mobian
Pin-Priority: -1
